id: point-blank-shot
name: Point Blank Shot
talentCategory: energy-attack
prerequisites: Enhanced Shot
description: >
  Knowing where to place your energy blasts for maximum effectiveness, the close range nature of your attacks makes them especially deadly.
text: >
  Point Blank Shot: Knowing where to place your energy blasts for maximum effectiveness, the close range nature of your attacks makes them especially deadly.
  –Prerequisites: Enhanced Shot
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of Energy Attacks made against adjacent Opponents by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you use the Energy Charge Maneuver within the Melee Range of an Opponent, use the declared Attacking Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver if it was an Energy Attack.

---

[passive]
# (1) Against each adjacent one alone (chat.mjs rangeParts).
wound.energy.adjacent += 1(T);
# (2) The Energy Charge Maneuver used with an Opponent within your Melee Range, the declared Attacking Maneuver an Energy
# Attack: it offered on the Energy Charge's card, out of sequence, as an Energy Attack - taken, once an Encounter (chat.mjs
# offerPointBlank, takePointBlank).
allow charge.pointBlank;
